{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "START",
      "type": "start",
      "text": "Good evening. Let’s reflect on your day.",
      "next": "A1_Q1"
    },
    {
      "id": "A1_Q1",
      "type": "question",
      "text": "How did your day feel overall?",
      "options": ["In control", "Mixed", "Out of control", "Frustrating"],
      "next": "A1_D1"
    },
    {
      "id": "A1_D1",
      "type": "decision",
      "rules": {
        "In control": "A1_Q2_INT",
        "Mixed": "A1_Q2_INT",
        "Out of control": "A1_Q2_EXT",
        "Frustrating": "A1_Q2_EXT"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "A1_Q2_INT",
      "type": "question",
      "text": "What helped things go well?",
      "options": ["My preparation", "My decisions", "Team support", "Adaptability"],
      "signal": "axis1:internal",
      "next": "A1_REF_INT"
    },
    {
      "id": "A1_Q2_EXT",
      "type": "question",
      "text": "When things went wrong, what did you feel?",
      "options": ["Others caused it", "Bad luck", "No control", "I felt stuck"],
      "signal": "axis1:external",
      "next": "A1_REF_EXT"
    },
    {
      "id": "A1_REF_INT",
      "type": "reflection",
      "text": "You recognized your role in outcomes today. That’s a strong sense of agency.",
      "next": "A1_Q3"
    },
    {
      "id": "A1_REF_EXT",
      "type": "reflection",
      "text": "It felt like things were outside your control. But even small choices matter — can you spot one?",
      "next": "A1_Q3"
    },
    {
      "id": "A1_Q3",
      "type": "question",
      "text": "When facing a challenge, what did you actually do?",
      "options": [
        "Tried different approaches",
        "Waited for help",
        "Avoided it",
        "Handled it step by step"
      ],
      "next": "A1_D2"
    },
    {
      "id": "A1_D2",
      "type": "decision",
      "rules": {
        "Tried different approaches": "A1_REF_INT2",
        "Handled it step by step": "A1_REF_INT2",
        "Waited for help": "A1_REF_EXT2",
        "Avoided it": "A1_REF_EXT2"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "A1_REF_INT2",
      "type": "reflection",
      "text": "Even in difficulty, you acted. That’s ownership — small actions build control.",
      "signal": "axis1:internal",
      "next": "BRIDGE_1_2"
    },
    {
      "id": "A1_REF_EXT2",
      "type": "reflection",
      "text": "Pausing or waiting is natural. But growth begins when you take even one small step.",
      "signal": "axis1:external",
      "next": "BRIDGE_1_2"
    },
    {
      "id": "BRIDGE_1_2",
      "type": "bridge",
      "text": "Now let’s look at what you gave today.",
      "next": "A2_Q1"
    },
    {
      "id": "A2_Q1",
      "type": "question",
      "text": "Which moment stands out?",
      "options": [
        "Helped someone",
        "Did extra work",
        "Expected recognition",
        "Felt others didn’t do enough"
      ],
      "next": "A2_D1"
    },
    {
      "id": "A2_D1",
      "type": "decision",
      "rules": {
        "Helped someone": "A2_REF_CONTRIB",
        "Did extra work": "A2_REF_CONTRIB",
        "Expected recognition": "A2_REF_ENTITLE",
        "Felt others didn’t do enough": "A2_REF_ENTITLE"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "A2_REF_CONTRIB",
      "type": "reflection",
      "text": "You focused on contributing beyond yourself. That builds trust and impact.",
      "signal": "axis2:contribution",
      "next": "A2_Q2"
    },
    {
      "id": "A2_REF_ENTITLE",
      "type": "reflection",
      "text": "You were aware of what you expected. What might shift if you focused on what you could give?",
      "signal": "axis2:entitlement",
      "next": "A2_Q2"
    },
    {
      "id": "A2_Q2",
      "type": "question",
      "text": "How did you react when your effort wasn’t noticed?",
      "options": [
        "Still continued helping",
        "Felt demotivated",
        "Expected appreciation",
        "Did only what was required"
      ],
      "next": "A2_D2"
    },
    {
      "id": "A2_D2",
      "type": "decision",
      "rules": {
        "Still continued helping": "A2_REF_CONTRIB2",
        "Did only what was required": "A2_REF_CONTRIB2",
        "Felt demotivated": "A2_REF_ENTITLE2",
        "Expected appreciation": "A2_REF_ENTITLE2"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "A2_REF_CONTRIB2",
      "type": "reflection",
      "text": "You stayed focused on contribution, not validation. That builds long-term trust.",
      "signal": "axis2:contribution",
      "next": "BRIDGE_2_3"
    },
    {
      "id": "A2_REF_ENTITLE2",
      "type": "reflection",
      "text": "Wanting recognition is human. But contribution creates impact even when unseen.",
      "signal": "axis2:entitlement",
      "next": "BRIDGE_2_3"
    },
    {
      "id": "BRIDGE_2_3",
      "type": "bridge",
      "text": "Finally, let’s widen the perspective.",
      "next": "A3_Q1"
    },
    {
      "id": "A3_Q1",
      "type": "question",
      "text": "Who did today impact most?",
      "options": [
        "Only me",
        "My team",
        "A colleague",
        "Customers/users"
      ],
      "next": "A3_REF"
    },
    {
      "id": "A3_REF",
      "type": "reflection",
      "text": "The more you expand your view, the more meaning your work can hold.",
      "next": "A3_Q2"
    },
    {
      "id": "A3_Q2",
      "type": "question",
      "text": "When thinking about others today, what stood out?",
      "options": [
        "I supported someone",
        "I noticed others struggling",
        "I focused on my own tasks",
        "I didn’t think much about others"
      ],
      "next": "A3_D2"
    },
    {
      "id": "A3_D2",
      "type": "decision",
      "rules": {
        "I supported someone": "A3_REF_WIDE",
        "I noticed others struggling": "A3_REF_WIDE",
        "I focused on my own tasks": "A3_REF_NARROW",
        "I didn’t think much about others": "A3_REF_NARROW"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "A3_REF_WIDE",
      "type": "reflection",
      "text": "You extended beyond yourself today. That’s where meaning grows.",
      "signal": "axis3:wide",
      "next": "SUMMARY"
    },
    {
      "id": "A3_REF_NARROW",
      "type": "reflection",
      "text": "It’s easy to stay focused inward. Expanding your view can shift your experience.",
      "signal": "axis3:narrow",
      "next": "SUMMARY"
    },
    {
      "id": "SUMMARY",
      "type": "summary",
      "text": "Today, you leaned toward {axis1} control, {axis2} contribution, and a {axis3} perspective.",
      "next": "END"
    },
    {
      "id": "END",
      "type": "end",
      "text": "See you tomorrow."
    }
  ]
}